sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser Web Vitals
    participant C as Cloudflare Edge Worker
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant L as Ingestion Lambda
    participant N as SNS
    participant Q as SQS / DLQ
    participant E as ECS Fargate
    participant P as PostgreSQL / pgvector
    participant V as Evidence Readback
    participant O as AWS Pause Gate

    B->>C: POST /api/performance (request_id)
    C->>A: Sanitized envelope (request_id)
    A->>L: HTTP event
    L->>N: PerformanceRecorded
    N->>Q: Durable delivery
    Q->>E: Bounded batch
    E->>P: Aggregate and persist
    P-->>V: Query metric sample
    V-->>B: Public Evidence page and screenshot
    V->>O: Evidence readback confirmed
    O->>Q: Disable consumer trigger
    O->>E: Confirm running tasks = 0
